# Sources are written with LF, and the wiring tests read them as text. Pin LF so
# a Windows clone (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true) checks out
# the same bytes the tests were written against. The tests also normalize line
# endings when they read sources, so an editor saving CRLF cannot break them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
